    (LGPL-2.1+; cx-nx-compat.patch is by Alexander Theißen, from https://github.com/athei/wine commit
    539aa62220ad23a390ce9f2a1c99ee5d3831907b), DXMT (LGPL-2.1+, its code up to v0.80 MIT; Copyright (c) 2023-2026
    Feifan He for CodeWeavers, https://github.com/3Shain/dxmt), commit ce001dfbedd7116aa9beb2e816c6ba44e599c15d as
